//
// Host-only gate for the mixed-method o_ffn_qwen rewire (review of PR #50,
// P0): at seq 512/1024 the registry resolves the decoupled O to drain and the
// module must still build, co-linking _m32 drain GEMMs with the _m64
// fused-cast Down; at seq 2048 the prior all-fused 19-arg layout is pinned;
// and the host scratch plan mirrors the builder's scratch_for contract.
// IR/compile level: no device, no aircc, no downloads. Collected by the
// unfiltered check-programming-examples.
//
// RUN: %PYTHON %S/test_o_ffn_layout.py | FileCheck %s
//
// CHECK: PASS  test_checked_plan_binds_the_cache_to_the_registry
// CHECK: PASS  test_seq2048_layout_is_the_prior_all_fused_one
// CHECK: PASS  test_short_seq_mixed_methods_build
// CHECK: PASS  test_the_host_scratch_plan_matches_the_builder_contract
// CHECK: o_ffn layout tests: 4/4 passed
